  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"> \n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3aa06c5056e6b7f40e5cc3af34426c7581b8105c.png\">\n<h4>小巧精緻的擴充內容，專為與 Create 模組緊密整合而設計。</h4>\n\n<hr>\n<div>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-bits-n-bobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"Modrinth 上可用\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-bits-n-bobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"CurseForge 上可用\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Industrialists-Of-Create/Create-Bits-n-Bobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"GitHub 上可用\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\"></a>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"forge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"支援 Neoforge\" src=\"https://github.com/VladisCrafter/Create-IDLX/raw/main/README-images/neoforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"56\" alt=\"不支援 Fabric\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/unsupported/fabric_vector.svg\"></a>\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Primary-1.21.1-orange.svg?style=for-the-badge\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Supports-1.21.1/1.20.1-orange.svg?style=for-the-badge\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue.svg?style=for-the-badge\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.oreostack.uk%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/translations-CROWDIN-gold.svg?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n\n</div><p></p><hr><span><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SmQ71MCeq2w\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><p></p><hr><h2>功能列表</h2><ul>\n<li>基於齒輪的鏈條傳動（在 Create 的齒輪或法蘭齒輪上使用鏈條）</li>\n<li>數碼管變體（數碼管板與大型數碼管）</li>\n<li>椅子</li>\n<li>方塊內嵌式頭燈</li>\n<li>樑架支撐</li>\n<li>Ponderflat 世界預設</li>\n<li>風化樑</li>\n<li>鏈條滑輪變體</li>\n<li>瓷磚石材調色板</li>\n<li>燈泡與黃銅燈</li>\n</ul><h2>所有功能皆可配置！</h2><p>個別功能可透過設定檔停用，讓你能依喜好自訂模組。設定檔也允許調整特定模組數值的平衡性。</p><h2>可用翻譯&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.oreostack.uk%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">歡迎在 Crowdin 貢獻翻譯！</a></h2><ul>\n<li>簡體中文 (简体中文)</li>\n<li>葡萄牙文 (Português)</li>\n<li>巴西葡萄牙文 (Português do Brasil)</li>\n<li>俄文 (Русский)</li>\n<li>西班牙文 (Español)</li>\n<li>土耳其文 (Türkçe)</li>\n<li>烏克蘭文 (Українська)</li>\n<li>墨西哥西班牙文 (Español de México)</li>\n<li>海盜英文 (Pirate Speak)</li>\n</ul><h3>機器翻譯</h3><p>部分常見語言在遊戲內已有審核過的機器翻譯，但仍需人工譯者協助，我們非常感謝相關貢獻：</p><ul>\n<li>波蘭文 (Polski)</li>\n<li>法文 (Français)</li>\n<li>加拿大法文 (Français (Canada))</li>\n<li>瑞典文 (Svenska)</li>\n<li>荷蘭文 (Nederlands)</li>\n</ul><h2>榮耀歸於 AZ TECH</h2><p><strong><em>由 Cake、Kipti、Astral 與 NormalGuy 共同創作，特別感謝 mr mellz 協助鏈條傳動演算法</em></strong></p>",
